        <div class="alert alert-info d-flex align-items-start gap-2 small mb-3">
            <i class="bi bi-diagram-3 fs-5"></i>
            <div>
                <strong>How sources tie into workflows:</strong>
                a source binding (SFTP / SharePoint / REST / Cloud / Manual) polls on
                the schedule you set below. When a new file arrives, every row is
                handed to the project's <strong>active workflow</strong> — one
                <em>WorkflowInstance</em> per row. The workflow then drives the
                messaging (send SMS → wait for click / reply → reminder → escalate)
                using the column mappings to fill the SMS template.
                <br>
                <span class="text-muted">
                    Required: at least one column mapping in
                    <a href="#" onclick="gotoTab('#tab-mappings');return false;">Mappings</a>
                    and one active workflow in
                    <a href="#" onclick="gotoTab('#tab-workflows');return false;">Workflows</a>.
                    Without those, ingested rows are dropped to the rejected folder.
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
